# Per-developer AI/agent scaffolding. Anchored to the repository root and named
# explicitly on purpose: the previous globs (A*T.md, C*E.md, G*I.md) were not
# anchored, so they also swallowed plausible documents anywhere in the tree --
# docs/CONTRIBUTE.md, docs/CHANGE.md and docs/GUI.md would all have been
# invisible, with no error to notice.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/CODEX.md
/GEMINI.md
/MEMORY.md
/SKILLS.md
/workitems/
/.agent-workflow/
/.claude/
/.codex/
/.gemini/
/.cursorrules
/.ruler
/.mcp.json
